<title>USA: Tenn. Bond Authority $101 mln deal won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>Tenn. Bond Authority $101 mln deal won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Tuesday it won $101.5 million Tennessee State School Bond Authority higher education bonds at a true interest cost of 5.59 percent.</p>
</text>
